<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The light model the murakumo/aiueos debug loop runs against.

  Qwen3-0.6B-4bit, 336 MB on disk, because 27B is too heavy to iterate on:
  measured 2026-09-08 this answers in 0.23 s where murakumo-main's
  qwen3.8-27b-throughput-b70 is a fleet round trip.

  TWO THINGS THE CALLER MUST KNOW, both measured the same day:
    * `model` is resolved as a HuggingFace repo id, so it must be the full
      "mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit". "qwen3-0.6b" makes the server fetch
      https://huggingface.co/api/models/qwen3-0.6b and return the 404 as the
      completion.
    * Qwen3 emits <think> by default. Without
      "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false} the same one-word
      question costs 64 tokens and 1.79 s instead of 3 tokens and 0.23 s.

  ProcessType Adaptive, NOT Background. Background is not merely a CPU
  priority on macOS -- it applies IOPOL_THROTTLE to disk I/O, and measured
  2026-09-08 on the k16 node that turned a service restart into a ten-minute
  stall at load 126 while nothing was bound to its ports. Adaptive starts low
  and is promoted while the process is working.

  --prompt-cache-size 0. Measured 2026-09-08 with the cache on: asked for a
  prime between 10 and 20 immediately after asking for the capital of Japan,
  the answer came back "The capital of the prime number between 10 and" --
  the previous request's prompt leaking into this one's completion, twice in a
  row, and latency went from 0.23 s to 15-58 s. A debug instrument that
  silently returns the previous question's answer is worse than no instrument,
  so the cache is off: correctness of the measurement beats its speed.

  Binds 127.0.0.1 only. This is a debug endpoint on one workstation, not a
  fleet node: it is not reachable by murakumo and is deliberately not enrolled.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.gftd.qwen-debug</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin/mlx_lm.server</string>
    <string>--model</string><string>mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit</string>
    <string>--host</string><string>127.0.0.1</string>
    <string>--port</string><string>8081</string>
    <string>--prompt-cache-size</string><string>0</string>
  </array>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
  <key>KeepAlive</key><true/>
  <key>ThrottleInterval</key><integer>30</integer>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key><string>/Users/junkawasaki</string>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/junkawasaki/.gftd/qwen-debug.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/junkawasaki/.gftd/qwen-debug.log</string>
  <key>ProcessType</key><string>Adaptive</string>
</dict>
</plist>
